1
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:34,979
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,530 --> 00:01:37,950
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:57,580 --> 00:01:58,509
Are you alright?

4
00:02:00,690 --> 00:02:01,380
I'm fine.

5
00:02:02,740 --> 00:02:03,800
Then I'm relieved.

6
00:02:05,050 --> 00:02:06,850
Do you still have the negatives?

7
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:08,690
Keep the negatives safe,

8
00:02:08,690 --> 00:02:09,530
just in case.

9
00:02:11,610 --> 00:02:13,610
It's time to put them to use.

10
00:03:00,490 --> 00:03:01,870
Once you leave the police station,

11
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:03,530
I won't be able to protect you.

12
00:03:20,390 --> 00:03:22,350
So leaving now is not a good idea.

13
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,930
I can detain you for a little longer.

14
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,680
No need.

15
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,290
I received 2 sets of photos.

16
00:04:57,570 --> 00:05:01,250
One shows Inspector Su
colluding with the Communists.

17
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:04,520
The other shows

18
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:08,240
the details of No. 76
embezzling public funds.

19
00:05:10,810 --> 00:05:12,080
One of you two

20
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,930
is lying.

21
00:05:18,450 --> 00:05:19,210
Director Li.

22
00:05:21,010 --> 00:05:23,740
That relative of yours
in the finance department

23
00:05:24,170 --> 00:05:25,900
cooked the books beautifully.

24
00:05:27,250 --> 00:05:29,610
Without this authentic ledger,

25
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:31,810
I'm afraid no one would know

26
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:33,560
how much
of the 300,000 special monthly fund

27
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,970
actually

28
00:05:34,970 --> 00:05:36,430
went into your own pocket.

29
00:05:43,250 --> 00:05:46,110
You think you can use a few random words
in a notebook

30
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:48,020
to frame anyone?

31
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,970
You can also forge evidence of me
colluding with the Communists

32
00:05:54,970 --> 00:05:56,300
and plant it in my house.

33
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,760
Come in.

34
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:14,710
This is your man, right?

35
00:06:34,050 --> 00:06:36,450
You didn't even spare the women's jewelry,

36
00:06:37,290 --> 00:06:39,490
and you still claim you're not corrupt?

37
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:45,570
How did Inspector Su's belongings
end up in your hands?

38
00:06:51,170 --> 00:06:52,880
I... I'll talk.

39
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,440
They sent people to search your house

40
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,770
and couldn't find evidence of collusion,

41
00:06:58,770 --> 00:06:59,770
so they forged it.

42
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:03,070
Ding Awang gave me a radio
and some documents

43
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,780
implicating Inspector Su in collusion
with the Communists.

44
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:06,640
He told me to take them to her house

45
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,220
and plant them as evidence
of her collusion.

46
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,810
As a reward,

47
00:07:12,170 --> 00:07:13,880
he said we... we could keep the valuables

48
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,740
for ourselves.

49
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,760
You turned my house upside down.

50
00:07:20,250 --> 00:07:21,910
Weren't you afraid I'd get out

51
00:07:22,290 --> 00:07:23,950
and settle the score with you?

52
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:26,180
Ding Awang said

53
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,930
you wouldn't come back alive.

54
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,080
It was Captain Du's order.

55
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:39,640
Louder!

56
00:07:40,810 --> 00:07:43,140
Ding Awang said it was Captain Du's order!

57
00:08:02,200 --> 00:08:03,050
Captain Du,

58
00:08:04,450 --> 00:08:05,840
was it your order?

59
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:08,000
Searching your house was my order,

60
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,320
but the framing

61
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:11,100
had nothing to do with me.

62
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:16,970
Ding Awang is your right-hand man.

63
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:19,880
Without your order,

64
00:08:20,610 --> 00:08:21,740
would he have dared?

65
00:08:24,490 --> 00:08:26,560
Ding Awang always talks nonsense.

66
00:08:26,750 --> 00:08:28,750
It might just be empty talk.

67
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:41,850
What about these?

68
00:08:48,730 --> 00:08:49,400
These.

69
00:08:52,370 --> 00:08:53,970
How do you explain it?

70
00:08:59,690 --> 00:09:01,490
To cover up the embezzlement,
you framed me

71
00:09:01,490 --> 00:09:03,290
for colluding with Communists.

72
00:09:04,730 --> 00:09:05,760
You colluded with the Green Gang,

73
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,000
trying to silence me.

74
00:09:12,370 --> 00:09:14,160
Cui Enxi was a civil servant

75
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,890
officially employed
by the Nanjing Government.

76
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:19,650
And she was brutally

77
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,600
murdered by you like that
in broad daylight!

78
00:09:26,870 --> 00:09:28,200
How do you explain that?

79
00:09:40,610 --> 00:09:42,870
I failed to discipline my subordinates.

80
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:44,880
I will resign to take responsibility

81
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,280
and await my punishment.

82
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:53,160
A human life cannot be repaid

83
00:09:53,810 --> 00:09:55,270
just by your resignation.

84
00:09:58,400 --> 00:09:59,040
Of course.

85
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,610
A life for a life.

86
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:02,970
Ding Awang

87
00:10:04,050 --> 00:10:05,710
should be brought to justice.

88
00:10:15,090 --> 00:10:15,880
Director Li.

89
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:18,780
What about you?

90
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Such a serious accusation
as embezzling public funds

91
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,280
cannot be proven

92
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,800
by just one ledger.

93
00:10:29,730 --> 00:10:31,880
But as the head of No. 76,

94
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,890
I am willing to accept any investigation.

95
00:10:39,580 --> 00:10:41,620
All subsequent matters

96
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,900
will be fully entrusted to Inspector Su.

97
00:10:49,570 --> 00:10:51,330
Considering the risks
you face in Shanghai,

98
00:10:51,330 --> 00:10:54,130
the Ministry of Finance
of the Central Government

99
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:55,570
can approve your return

100
00:10:55,570 --> 00:10:57,230
to work in Nanjing at any time.

101
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,880
Even if I die, I will die in Shanghai.

102
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:06,280
My inspection mission is not yet complete.

103
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:09,570
Chairman Wang was right about you.

104
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,850
The corrupt officials

105
00:11:11,970 --> 00:11:14,250
mentioned in the ledger, led by Li Moqun—

106
00:11:14,370 --> 00:11:16,300
I will investigate them one by one.

107
00:11:16,490 --> 00:11:17,610
The Chairman personally ordered

108
00:11:17,610 --> 00:11:20,490
that the bandits
who attacked government officials

109
00:11:20,490 --> 00:11:22,160
must be severely punished.

110
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:24,710
I appreciate Chairman Wang's concern.

111
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:36,110
-Freeze!
-Freeze! Freeze!

112
00:12:08,090 --> 00:12:09,020
Take them alive!

113
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:55,280
A life for a life.

114
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:58,610
Is that enough?

115
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:12,060
Not even close.

116
00:13:17,900 --> 00:13:18,970
They are just

117
00:13:18,970 --> 00:13:20,760
scapegoats following orders.

118
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,760
The man behind them is Li Moqun.

119
00:13:24,670 --> 00:13:28,270
The evidence of Li Moqun
embezzling public funds is conclusive.

120
00:13:28,970 --> 00:13:31,090
How he should be dealt with still requires

121
00:13:31,090 --> 00:13:33,800
Chairman Wang's personal decision.

122
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,280
Director Ding has been

123
00:13:36,730 --> 00:13:38,490
There's more going on

124
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:39,910
behind the scenes.

125
00:14:04,810 --> 00:14:06,300
I'm responsible for this.

126
00:14:07,250 --> 00:14:09,460
I failed to discipline
my subordinates properly

127
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:11,000
and disappointed the Chairman.

128
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,250
The Chairman is very angry

129
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:14,780
[Director Ding, Special Agent Committee]

130
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:13,800
and doesn't want to talk to you.

131
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,060
Don't you understand?

132
00:14:15,830 --> 00:14:17,090
I will resign to take responsibility

133
00:14:17,090 --> 00:14:18,910
and give the Japanese an explanation,

134
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:22,170
as a way of repaying the Chairman
for his years of guidance.

135
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:24,400
What's the use of your resignation?

136
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:26,600
Don't pull this trick on me all the time!

137
00:14:26,610 --> 00:14:28,040
The key now

138
00:14:28,250 --> 00:14:30,780
is to keep this matter
from going any further!

139
00:14:30,970 --> 00:14:31,770
Fortunately,

140
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:35,850
Yu Yingxiang left your name
out of the ledger.

141
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:36,840
You...

142
00:14:53,370 --> 00:14:54,120
Director Li,

143
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,330
I tried my best to plead

144
00:14:57,730 --> 00:14:58,730
with the Chairman

145
00:14:58,730 --> 00:15:00,330
and got you another chance.

146
00:15:00,920 --> 00:15:02,580
You'd better watch your step.

147
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:04,730
Thank you, Director Ding.

148
00:15:04,730 --> 00:15:06,000
Please thank the Chairman

149
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,520
for giving me this chance.

150
00:15:08,490 --> 00:15:09,290
Rest assured.

151
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:12,680
I can minimize the impact.

152
00:15:14,300 --> 00:15:17,020
I won't let you down.

153
00:15:17,450 --> 00:15:18,090
Alright.

154
00:15:18,730 --> 00:15:20,390
Let's leave it at that for now.

155
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,410
You made a beautiful comeback this round.

156
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:37,990
But what a pity.

157
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:40,850
If it were me,

158
00:16:41,450 --> 00:16:44,760
I wouldn't have given my opponent
any chance to fight back.

159
00:16:51,570 --> 00:16:52,900
There's plenty of time.

160
00:17:37,650 --> 00:17:40,840
Are you missing those fallen comrades?

161
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,000
Not comrades.

162
00:17:49,890 --> 00:17:50,890
They were family.

163
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:54,480
And I'm not missing them.

164
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:57,010
It's a farewell.

165
00:18:04,970 --> 00:18:05,970
Anyway,

166
00:18:07,250 --> 00:18:09,320
congratulations on surviving the ordeal.

167
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,720
Welcome back to the team.

168
00:18:21,410 --> 00:18:23,470
I managed to save these when they were

169
00:18:23,970 --> 00:18:25,300
ransacking your house.

170
00:18:29,610 --> 00:18:31,760
You look good in these shoes.

171
00:18:42,470 --> 00:18:43,120
Thank you.

172
00:18:45,650 --> 00:18:46,410
What a pity.

173
00:18:48,010 --> 00:18:50,210
Even this couldn't bring Li Moqun down.

174
00:18:50,890 --> 00:18:51,840
And Du Huangqiao

175
00:18:52,690 --> 00:18:53,930
was only dismissed.

176
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:03,640
Li Moqun has deep roots
in the Nanjing Government.

177
00:19:04,750 --> 00:19:06,550
None of the witnesses survived.

178
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:09,890
These officials

179
00:19:10,170 --> 00:19:12,130
are rotten from top to bottom.

180
00:19:13,560 --> 00:19:15,450
It's impossible to bring him down

181
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:17,560
on corruption charges.

182
00:19:30,210 --> 00:19:32,080
The skies will clear one day.

183
00:19:34,650 --> 00:19:36,180
As long as we keep believing

184
00:19:37,130 --> 00:19:38,280
and fighting for it.

185
00:19:43,890 --> 00:19:44,760
I didn't expect

186
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,560
you to be the last one left.

187
00:20:22,800 --> 00:20:23,690
There's news.

188
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:26,960
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

189
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:28,640
It's about Project Slumber.

190
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:03,070
You've been dismissed.

191
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:07,210
Why do you think I'll still use you?

192
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:12,040
You don't care who attacked Su Men,

193
00:21:12,550 --> 00:21:15,080
let alone the dead bodyguard.

194
00:21:15,570 --> 00:21:17,410
I know that much.

195
00:21:19,600 --> 00:21:21,040
What you care about

196
00:21:21,450 --> 00:21:23,450
is who's more useful to you.

197
00:21:24,690 --> 00:21:26,290
And my intelligence network

198
00:21:26,570 --> 00:21:28,370
will definitely be of use to you.

199
00:21:29,730 --> 00:21:33,460
I've long heard that Cleaner is a master
in the intelligence field.

200
00:21:34,130 --> 00:21:35,130
I'm all ears.

201
00:21:38,560 --> 00:21:40,760
There's an NBIS mole inside your ranks.

202
00:21:42,970 --> 00:21:45,630
They've already made a move
on Project Slumber.

203
00:21:52,080 --> 00:21:53,650
Where did you learn this?

204
00:21:56,840 --> 00:21:58,890
I dug up an NBIS stronghold.

205
00:21:59,040 --> 00:21:59,840
Tomorrow,

206
00:22:00,370 --> 00:22:02,690
your mole will meet with God of Wealth.

207
00:22:04,610 --> 00:22:07,010
How much do you know about
Project Slumber?

208
00:22:08,970 --> 00:22:10,280
I know nothing,

209
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:11,630
and I don't want to know.

210
00:22:12,760 --> 00:22:14,560
I'm just an executioner.

211
00:22:14,970 --> 00:22:17,840
I can help you deal with the NBIS.

212
00:22:27,880 --> 00:22:30,310
I've always appreciated your abilities.

213
00:22:31,450 --> 00:22:32,210
Work hard,

214
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:35,760
and I can secure a good future for you.

215
00:22:37,170 --> 00:22:39,080
My future is very important to me.

216
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:41,010
But what's more important to me now

217
00:22:43,560 --> 00:22:45,320
is who God of Wealth is.

218
00:22:48,720 --> 00:22:49,850
You want revenge?

219
00:22:54,140 --> 00:22:55,940
The shot that killed my woman

220
00:22:57,430 --> 00:22:58,890
was fired by God of Wealth.

221
00:23:02,650 --> 00:23:03,690
I support you.

222
00:23:06,090 --> 00:23:07,220
Thank you, General.

223
00:23:28,170 --> 00:23:28,930
Jinbao.

224
00:23:31,080 --> 00:23:32,340
I'm leaving tomorrow.

225
00:23:33,250 --> 00:23:34,250
I know that.

226
00:23:34,600 --> 00:23:36,200
Haven't you already told me?

227
00:23:36,490 --> 00:23:39,280
Why don't you go with me?

228
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,410
Aren't you bankrupt?

229
00:23:44,450 --> 00:23:45,650
You have no money now.

230
00:23:46,410 --> 00:23:48,010
Why would I still follow you?

231
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:49,800
In Chongqing,

232
00:23:50,080 --> 00:23:52,080
we'll open another small match factory.

233
00:23:52,080 --> 00:23:53,880
I'm very good at making matches.

234
00:23:53,970 --> 00:23:55,230
Just give me some time.

235
00:23:56,360 --> 00:23:57,130
No way.

236
00:23:58,250 --> 00:24:00,800
I'm staying in Shanghai from now on.

237
00:24:01,840 --> 00:24:03,450
Just imagine me as

238
00:24:04,450 --> 00:24:05,450
a utility pole.

239
00:24:07,130 --> 00:24:08,460
I'm not joking with you.

240
00:24:09,090 --> 00:24:10,280
I really can't let you go.

241
00:24:10,280 --> 00:24:12,480
It's dangerous for you to be here alone.

242
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,130
How is it dangerous?

243
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:16,250
Can those men eat me?

244
00:24:16,820 --> 00:24:17,880
It's Du Huangqiao.

245
00:24:19,690 --> 00:24:20,890
He's very dangerous.

246
00:24:24,090 --> 00:24:25,750
What does he have to do with me?

247
00:24:27,130 --> 00:24:28,320
That day at MGM,

248
00:24:29,280 --> 00:24:30,410
I saw everything.

249
00:24:36,220 --> 00:24:37,750
You managed to escape once,

250
00:24:38,220 --> 00:24:39,880
but can you escape every time?

251
00:24:43,020 --> 00:24:44,330
So what if I can't?

252
00:24:45,370 --> 00:24:46,300
You'll die!

253
00:24:47,820 --> 00:24:49,220
What's with the yelling?

254
00:24:50,740 --> 00:24:52,340
What's so scary about death?

255
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:58,330
Death isn't scary.

256
00:24:59,340 --> 00:25:01,070
What's scary is that the living

257
00:25:01,540 --> 00:25:03,470
will live in fear and have no peace!

258
00:25:04,820 --> 00:25:07,420
That day,
to take over the match factory, No. 76

259
00:25:07,850 --> 00:25:09,410
falsely accused my father

260
00:25:09,410 --> 00:25:10,940
of colluding with the NBIS.

261
00:25:11,610 --> 00:25:13,220
He was locked up in No. 76.

262
00:25:13,850 --> 00:25:15,020
No matter how hard I tried
to pull strings,

263
00:25:15,020 --> 00:25:16,680
I couldn't get any news of him.

264
00:25:18,550 --> 00:25:19,720
All I could do

265
00:25:20,610 --> 00:25:21,690
was wait at home.

266
00:25:22,650 --> 00:25:23,980
But I waited and waited,

267
00:25:24,810 --> 00:25:25,580
only to learn

268
00:25:26,460 --> 00:25:29,520
that he had taken his own life
out of fear of punishment.

269
00:25:29,610 --> 00:25:31,350
My father never colluded with the NBIS!

270
00:25:31,350 --> 00:25:32,560
You killed him!

271
00:25:36,390 --> 00:25:37,780
What a good knife.

272
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:41,330
This is my 18th birthday present
from my father.

273
00:25:41,330 --> 00:25:42,330
Give it back to me!

274
00:25:47,500 --> 00:25:48,560
Alright, alright.

275
00:25:49,580 --> 00:25:50,580
I'll give it back.

276
00:25:51,890 --> 00:25:52,890
Give me your hand.

277
00:26:14,030 --> 00:26:15,580
Such little courage?

278
00:26:16,820 --> 00:26:19,130
You are nothing compared to your old man.

279
00:26:30,980 --> 00:26:34,240
Inspector Su will probably send someone
to ask questions.

280
00:26:37,300 --> 00:26:38,830
You know what to say, right?

281
00:26:42,650 --> 00:26:43,890
I'll count to three.

282
00:26:46,370 --> 00:26:47,170
One...

283
00:26:49,690 --> 00:26:50,580
Two...

284
00:26:50,890 --> 00:26:51,540
I do!

285
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:56,260
My father committed suicide
out of fear of punishment.

286
00:26:56,370 --> 00:26:59,700
And my family agreed
to have the match factory confiscated,

287
00:27:01,300 --> 00:27:02,700
without any complaints.

288
00:27:06,290 --> 00:27:07,260
Good boy.

289
00:27:07,780 --> 00:27:09,640
Since you had a knife in your hand,

290
00:27:10,130 --> 00:27:12,190
why didn't you just stab him to death?

291
00:27:14,300 --> 00:27:15,300
My father and I

292
00:27:16,180 --> 00:27:17,850
only know how to make matches.

293
00:27:19,330 --> 00:27:21,590
The quality of the matches is quite good.

294
00:27:25,300 --> 00:27:26,980
Do you think you are pitiful?

295
00:27:29,130 --> 00:27:30,090
He bullied you

296
00:27:30,650 --> 00:27:32,310
because you are too cowardly.

297
00:27:32,500 --> 00:27:33,410
Go back.

298
00:27:36,060 --> 00:27:37,610
Mr. Fang, the owner of Sanxing Chemical,

299
00:27:37,610 --> 00:27:39,410
was driven to his death by No. 76!

300
00:27:40,580 --> 00:27:42,040
He was only 47 when he died.

301
00:27:42,540 --> 00:27:44,610
What's the use of his title,
King of Domestic Goods?

302
00:27:44,610 --> 00:27:46,070
Try yelling one more time!

303
00:27:48,980 --> 00:27:50,580
Mr. Fang was driven to death by them.

304
00:27:50,580 --> 00:27:52,300
And my father was driven to death by them!

305
00:27:52,300 --> 00:27:53,930
Next, it will be you and me!

306
00:27:54,460 --> 00:27:55,410
I'm telling you,

307
00:27:55,410 --> 00:27:57,940
it's very dangerous for you
to go on like this!

308
00:28:01,170 --> 00:28:02,460
Many people have died.

309
00:28:03,370 --> 00:28:04,370
Will running away

310
00:28:04,610 --> 00:28:06,850
make this country less dangerous?

311
00:28:20,600 --> 00:28:21,800
What a coward.

312
00:28:38,060 --> 00:28:39,950
[Fairy Bath]

313
00:28:58,490 --> 00:28:59,360
You're here.

314
00:29:01,800 --> 00:29:04,400
Seeing the lights at Fairy Bath finally
come on

315
00:29:04,690 --> 00:29:07,220
reminded me
that you'd taken over this place.

316
00:29:13,120 --> 00:29:14,970
Xiaoxian and Awang are gone.

317
00:29:16,930 --> 00:29:18,690
I don't know how to do business,

318
00:29:19,590 --> 00:29:20,960
so I just closed it down.

319
00:29:24,930 --> 00:29:26,460
Where have you been lately?

320
00:29:27,530 --> 00:29:30,010
I couldn't find you anywhere.

321
00:29:32,450 --> 00:29:34,250
I went back to my old profession,

322
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,570
playing the three-stringed lute.

323
00:29:36,660 --> 00:29:38,590
Playing the three-stringed lute?

324
00:29:39,160 --> 00:29:41,090
You're not short of money, are you?

325
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,290
Drive for me later.

326
00:29:50,450 --> 00:29:51,850
I need you to come with me.

327
00:29:52,840 --> 00:29:53,560
Where to?

328
00:29:57,010 --> 00:29:58,450
Have you heard of an...

329
00:29:59,290 --> 00:30:02,050
NBIS agent codenamed God of Wealth?

330
00:30:11,840 --> 00:30:12,560
You have?

331
00:30:15,980 --> 00:30:16,660
I have.

332
00:30:28,080 --> 00:30:28,880
Today,

333
00:30:29,970 --> 00:30:31,970
I'll open your eyes.

334
00:30:36,730 --> 00:30:37,660
Where is Jinbao?

335
00:30:38,450 --> 00:30:39,380
Where is Jinbao?

336
00:30:39,840 --> 00:30:41,880
She went to see Young Master Feng off.

337
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:42,730
Go find her.

338
00:30:43,210 --> 00:30:45,410
Go find her. Tell her Du Huangqiao
is going to make an arrest this afternoon

339
00:30:45,410 --> 00:30:47,270
and seek revenge on God of Wealth.

340
00:30:47,690 --> 00:30:48,600
You hear me?

341
00:30:50,990 --> 00:30:51,670
Go now!

342
00:30:51,950 --> 00:30:52,540
Alright.

343
00:31:00,610 --> 00:31:02,140
You went to get your camera?

344
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,820
I also brought the gun you gave me.

345
00:31:07,730 --> 00:31:10,120
A gun will rust if it's not used.

346
00:31:21,690 --> 00:31:22,400
Eat up.

347
00:31:22,730 --> 00:31:23,400
What?

348
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:26,880
Do you look down on me
for only treating you to wontons?

349
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:32,690
Here.

350
00:31:41,600 --> 00:31:42,560
What is this for?

351
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:46,600
Didn't I borrow 5,000 yuan
from you before?

352
00:31:46,600 --> 00:31:47,290
Count it.

353
00:31:50,210 --> 00:31:50,930
Jinbao,

354
00:31:51,660 --> 00:31:53,790
you are the first person to pay me back.

355
00:31:54,730 --> 00:31:56,860
Don't make yourself sound so pitiful.

356
00:31:56,980 --> 00:31:58,460
I, Jinbao, am known

357
00:31:58,490 --> 00:31:59,730
for being trustworthy.

358
00:31:59,730 --> 00:32:02,260
I would never borrow money
and not pay it back.

359
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:05,730
Jinbao, I know.

360
00:32:06,050 --> 00:32:07,080
You care about me.

361
00:32:07,490 --> 00:32:08,890
You're afraid I won't have enough money

362
00:32:08,890 --> 00:32:12,090
to get by after I leave.
That's why you're giving me money.

363
00:32:12,400 --> 00:32:13,970
You are the kindest,

364
00:32:14,320 --> 00:32:15,580
best girl in the world.

365
00:32:16,090 --> 00:32:17,560
Don't flatter yourself.

366
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:20,370
Mr. Chen said the same thing about you.

367
00:32:21,120 --> 00:32:21,750
Really?

368
00:32:23,560 --> 00:32:24,760
Something like that.

369
00:32:43,320 --> 00:32:44,640
Keep this house.

370
00:33:05,900 --> 00:33:06,530
Why?

371
00:33:08,080 --> 00:33:10,320
Don't worry. This is my mother's dowry.

372
00:33:10,410 --> 00:33:11,530
No one knows about it,

373
00:33:11,530 --> 00:33:12,640
not even my father.

374
00:33:13,320 --> 00:33:15,580
So it wasn't discovered by those people.

375
00:33:15,700 --> 00:33:16,560
It's very safe.

376
00:33:22,100 --> 00:33:23,800
What does this have to do with me?

377
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:24,640
Listen to me,

378
00:33:24,930 --> 00:33:25,660
keep it well.

379
00:33:26,560 --> 00:33:28,320
In case of an emergency in the future,

380
00:33:28,320 --> 00:33:29,850
you'll have a place to stay.

381
00:33:36,530 --> 00:33:38,060
Chen Kailai sent a message,

382
00:33:38,220 --> 00:33:41,150
saying Du Huangqiao
is going to arrest God of Wealth.

383
00:33:44,180 --> 00:33:45,950
Go to Sanguantang Road, hurry.

384
00:33:46,250 --> 00:33:47,450
Why are we still going?

385
00:33:47,450 --> 00:33:48,510
Hurry up and drive.

386
00:34:08,230 --> 00:34:09,510
Is their meeting place

387
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,550
Wu's Grocery Store?

388
00:34:15,600 --> 00:34:17,530
You're more and more like an agent.

389
00:34:19,850 --> 00:34:21,050
When are they coming?

390
00:34:38,199 --> 00:34:39,159
You go first.

391
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:41,120
Let me go instead.

392
00:34:42,050 --> 00:34:43,489
It's too dangerous for you to go!

393
00:34:43,489 --> 00:34:44,350
Get out of here.

394
00:34:44,679 --> 00:34:45,810
Don't cause trouble.

395
00:34:45,810 --> 00:34:47,210
I'm leaving soon anyway.

396
00:34:47,679 --> 00:34:49,610
I'll be fine once I leave Shanghai.

397
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,820
If I do something for you before I leave,

398
00:34:51,820 --> 00:34:52,949
you'll remember me!

399
00:34:52,969 --> 00:34:54,370
Just go when I tell you to!

400
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,320
You have to stay alive

401
00:34:59,240 --> 00:35:00,500
for me to remember you.

402
00:35:35,850 --> 00:35:36,890
A catty of dates

403
00:35:37,160 --> 00:35:38,690
and a can of yellow peaches.

404
00:35:49,460 --> 00:35:51,460
We're out of canned yellow peaches.

405
00:36:05,850 --> 00:36:07,780
[Canned Food Sold Out]

406
00:36:09,580 --> 00:36:11,840
There's something wrong with this sign.

407
00:37:03,760 --> 00:37:04,410
Stop!

408
00:37:17,410 --> 00:37:18,340
Don't be afraid.

409
00:37:19,010 --> 00:37:20,760
When you dodge bullets long enough,

410
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,760
you get used to it.

411
00:37:23,450 --> 00:37:24,910
I know this marksmanship.

412
00:37:25,160 --> 00:37:26,360
It's God of Wealth's.

413
00:37:26,850 --> 00:37:27,730
Stay hidden.

414
00:37:35,240 --> 00:37:36,010
Stay hidden.

415
00:37:47,180 --> 00:37:48,200
I'll kill you!

416
00:38:37,680 --> 00:38:39,330
Did God of Wealth send you?

417
00:38:44,300 --> 00:38:45,210
I'm here...

418
00:38:45,920 --> 00:38:47,070
for revenge.

419
00:39:15,450 --> 00:39:16,450
Who isn't?

420
00:39:50,890 --> 00:39:52,620
He said he was here for revenge.

421
00:39:56,790 --> 00:39:57,790
Do you believe it?

422
00:40:07,890 --> 00:40:09,750
Even a cornered rabbit will bite.

423
00:40:13,720 --> 00:40:14,760
Who won't?

424
00:40:16,450 --> 00:40:18,310
Couldn't he wait a little longer?

425
00:41:02,850 --> 00:41:04,810
Goodbye, my love.

426
00:41:05,050 --> 00:41:06,780
I'll wait for you in Chongqing.

427
00:41:11,080 --> 00:41:12,450
I'm not your love.

428
00:41:16,110 --> 00:41:17,090
Idiot.

429
00:41:23,330 --> 00:41:24,330
Coward!

430
00:41:28,470 --> 00:41:30,270
I'm not going to look for you!

431
00:41:44,530 --> 00:41:46,170
Who told you to come?

432
00:41:49,500 --> 00:41:51,100
Who told you to come?

433
00:42:13,180 --> 00:42:14,750
This world is too small.

434
00:42:16,090 --> 00:42:17,020
What do you mean?

435
00:42:17,970 --> 00:42:20,300
Where there are people, there is society.

436
00:42:21,450 --> 00:42:23,080
But the society around me

437
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:24,780
is full of acquaintances.

438
00:42:35,930 --> 00:42:37,460
How has Jinbao been lately?

439
00:42:40,050 --> 00:42:41,050
How could she be?

440
00:42:42,450 --> 00:42:45,050
Drinking and dancing every day,

441
00:42:45,490 --> 00:42:46,770
getting dead drunk.

442
00:42:49,490 --> 00:42:50,240
From now on,

443
00:42:51,240 --> 00:42:52,970
no one will take her home.

444
00:42:58,760 --> 00:43:00,230
Let's go check on her.
